{"rows":[{"cols":[{"designInfo":{"stencilSuperIds":["Output"],"stencilId":"cloud-output"},"label":"Configuration complete","value":"<p>The Data X-Ray operating-model setup has finished. Summary:</p><ul><li><b>Created:</b> {{configureCreatedCount}} new element(s)</li><li><b>Already present:</b> {{configureSkippedCount}} element(s) left untouched</li><li><b>Failed:</b> {{configureFailedCount}} step(s)</li></ul><p>{{configureDetail}}</p><p><b>Run access:</b> the search &amp; sync workflows can now be run by the <b>Data X-Ray User</b> or <b>Data X-Ray Admin</b> role; setup is restricted to <b>Data X-Ray Admin</b> / Sysadmin. Assign users to these roles in <i>Settings &rarr; Roles</i>. If any workflow shows as &ldquo;not deployed yet&rdquo; above, deploy it and re-run this workflow.</p><p><b>Next step:</b> a <b>Data X-Ray Admin</b> or Sysadmin must open each of the Sync Data X-Ray Classifications, Sync Data X-Ray Classification (Nightly) and Search Data X-Ray workflows' settings pages and set the Data X-Ray Base URL and Bearer token (the only two settings each one needs). Full per-step detail is in <code>dgc.log</code>. Click <b>Send</b> to close this workflow.</p>","defaultValue":false,"size":12,"ignore":false,"visible":true,"enabled":true,"isRequired":false,"id":"configureResultsSummary","type":"htmlComponent"}]}],"metadata":{"key":"configureResultsForm","name":"Configuration Results","description":"Displays what the Data X-Ray operating-model bootstrap created, skipped and configured.","version":"1","modelType":"form","flowableDesignVersion":3110,"palette":"flowable-core-form-palette"}}
